      <title>芯联集成8英寸碳化硅晶圆下线 与理想汽车深化供应链合作</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/%E8%8A%AF%E8%81%94%E9%9B%86%E6%88%908%E8%8B%B1%E5%AF%B8%E7%A2%B3%E5%8C%96%E7%A1%85%E6%99%B6%E5%9C%86%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%BF-%E4%B8%8E%E7%90%86%E6%83%B3%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B7%B1%E5%8C%96%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%93%BE%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C/</link>
